\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {1}{\ignorespaces PoliteBurst{} architecture. The home client submits over a federated NATS leaf link. The in-cluster controller admits jobs, pacing concurrency to the politeness budget, and launches GPU worker pods whose results route back through the leaf. The dashed arc is the stale feedback the controller acts on, and its delay bounds the achievable advantage by Thm.~\ref {thm:limit}.}}{2}{figure.1}\protected@file@percent }
